    title: 'Male Hormone Panel — At Home Testosterone Test Kit',
    desc: 'Measures total and free testosterone, DHEA-S, and SHBG. Low testosterone in men is a significant and under-recognised driver of osteoporosis.',
    price: '$189.00',
    url: 'https://store.hrt.org/products/male-hormone-panel-testosterone-at-home-test-kit'
  },
  {
    img: 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0150/2081/8486/products/Thyroid_Health_Essentials_1024x1024_upclose_1024x1024@2x.png?v=1579640010',
    title: 'Comprehensive Bone Health Profile',
    desc: 'Includes vitamin D, calcium, parathyroid hormone (PTH), and key bone turnover markers — giving a complete picture of your bone formation and resorption rates.',
